&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your skills and interests:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ml-4&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;You design and develop efficient, scalable software solutions within both microservices and monolithic architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ml-4&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;You leverage your expertise in Java 17, Java EE7, and modern Java frameworks to build high-quality applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ml-4&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;You manage and optimize relational databases such as Oracle, MSSQL, or Postgres to ensure high performance.&lt;/li&gt;
